{"company":{"id":"doordash","name":"DoorDash","accent":"#eb1700","asset":"order tickets","verb":"order"},"nodes":[{"id":"client","title":"Customer app","kind":"client","blurb":"Search, book/order, track.","depth":0,"story":"This is the DoorDash app on your phone or laptop. Tapping order starts here. The app does not hold the whole product — it only starts the request."},{"id":"supply","title":"Supply app","kind":"client","blurb":"Driver, host, or merchant app.","depth":0,"story":"The other side of DoorDash: driver, host, or shop. Same company, different app, same front door."},{"id":"api","title":"API gateway","kind":"api","blurb":"One front door for both apps.","depth":1,"story":"Think of this as DoorDash’s front desk. The app asks it for “what’s allowed / what’s next,” not for huge order tickets. It routes, limits traffic, and hides internal stores."},{"id":"cdn","title":"CDN","kind":"cdn","blurb":"Photos, menus, and static maps tiles.","depth":1,"story":"On DoorDash, bulky order tickets are copied around the world. Play/browse should hit a nearby copy. If that copy is missing, a miss goes back to origin."},{"id":"auth","title":"Identity","kind":"auth","blurb":"Customer vs supply accounts.","depth":2,"story":"Before DoorDash shows anything private, it checks who you are (account, session, device). A CDN copy of a file is not the same as being logged in."},{"id":"match","title":"Matching / search","kind":"service","blurb":"Who is nearby and available.","depth":2,"story":"Who is nearby and free? DoorDash treats matching as its own service because location and availability change every second."},{"id":"pricing","title":"Pricing","kind":"service","blurb":"Quote, surge, fees.","depth":2,"story":"The quote you see (including busy-area pricing) is computed, not a single frozen number in a spreadsheet."},{"id":"geo","title":"Location service","kind":"service","blurb":"Pings, ETAs inputs, geofences — high write rate.","depth":3,"story":"Phones send location often. DoorDash needs a geo index — a normal list of users would be too slow to search by “near me.”"},{"id":"eta","title":"ETA service","kind":"service","blurb":"Turns pings + traffic into “arrives in 4 min.”","depth":3,"story":"“Arrives in 4 min” is estimated from pings and traffic. That is its own job, not a random guess in the matching service."},{"id":"cache","title":"Hot cache + geo index","kind":"cache","blurb":"Open supply and popular listings, queried constantly.","depth":3,"story":"The same questions get asked thousands of times (session, “is this still available?”). DoorDash keeps those answers in fast memory so the main database is not hit every time."},{"id":"tripdb","title":"Orders / trips DB","kind":"db","blurb":"The live job and its state machine.","depth":4,"story":"The live trip or order and its states (requested → assigned → done). Different from the catalog of what you can buy."},{"id":"listdb","title":"Catalog / listings DB","kind":"db","blurb":"What can be bought or booked.","depth":4,"story":"Homes, menu items, products — the catalog. Pictures of them live elsewhere."},{"id":"blob","title":"Media store","kind":"blob","blurb":"Listing and food photos.","depth":4,"story":"The warehouse for large order tickets. Cheap to store, not great for “show my last 20 items.” DoorDash points at these files from the records database."},{"id":"queue","title":"Dispatch queue","kind":"queue","blurb":"Notify supply without blocking checkout.","depth":5,"story":"Slow leftover work (encode, notify, payout) waits here after you already succeeded at order. The tap can return; workers finish later."},{"id":"pay","title":"Payments","kind":"workers","blurb":"Authorize, capture, payout.","depth":5,"story":"Money moves after the tap. DoorDash should not freeze the app while banks respond."},{"id":"notify","title":"Push / SMS","kind":"workers","blurb":"“Your driver is here.”","depth":6,"story":"“New episode” or “your driver is here” is a background ping. It is not part of the Play / tap request that already succeeded."},{"id":"maps","title":"Maps / routing","kind":"service","blurb":"Turn-by-turn and distance.","depth":6,"story":"Turn-by-turn is a map/routing product sitting next to DoorDash, not something every phone computes from scratch with no server."},{"id":"promo","title":"Promos / credits","kind":"service","blurb":"Coupons on the quote — not only in the app.","depth":2,"story":"Coupons and credits on DoorDash are rules on the quote — they should not live only in the app where people can cheat."},{"id":"kitchen","title":"Restaurant prep state","kind":"service","blurb":"Tracks accepted, cooking, ready, and picked-up separately from courier location.","depth":6,"story":"Tracks accepted, cooking, ready, and picked-up separately from courier location."}],"edges":[{"from":"client","to":"api","label":"search / order"},{"from":"supply","to":"api","label":"go online"},{"from":"client","to":"cdn","label":"photos"},{"from":"api","to":"auth","label":"who is this"},{"from":"api","to":"match","label":"find supply"},{"from":"api","to":"pricing","label":"quote"},{"from":"match","to":"geo","label":"where is everyone"},{"from":"match","to":"cache","label":"open supply"},{"from":"pricing","to":"cache","label":"hot prices"},{"from":"geo","to":"eta","label":"compute arrival"},{"from":"eta","to":"cache","label":"hot ETAs"},{"from":"match","to":"tripdb","label":"create job"},{"from":"match","to":"listdb","label":"what’s listed"},{"from":"cdn","to":"blob","label":"origin photos"},{"from":"api","to":"queue","label":"after tap"},{"from":"queue","to":"notify","label":"wake supply"},{"from":"queue","to":"pay","label":"charge later"},{"from":"pricing","to":"pay","label":"amount"},{"from":"geo","to":"maps","label":"route"},{"from":"pricing","to":"promo","label":"apply credit"},{"from":"queue","to":"kitchen","label":"update kitchen"}],"stages":[{"i":0,"blurb":"Two apps (customer and driver/host) share one front door. Photos already come from a nearby CDN.","unlockNodeIds":["client","supply","api","cdn"],"unlockEdgeIds":["client->api","supply->api","client->cdn","api->auth","api->match","api->pricing","cdn->blob","api->queue"]},{"i":1,"blurb":"Matching, price, and promos are their own services—not one database query.","unlockNodeIds":["auth","match","pricing","promo"],"unlockEdgeIds":["api->auth","api->match","api->pricing","match->geo","match->cache","pricing->cache","match->tripdb","match->listdb","pricing->pay","pricing->promo"]},{"i":2,"blurb":"Phones send location often. A geo index plus cache, and a separate ETA service, keep maps snappy.","unlockNodeIds":["geo","eta","cache"],"unlockEdgeIds":["match->geo","match->cache","pricing->cache","geo->eta","eta->cache","geo->maps"]},{"i":3,"blurb":"Live trips, the catalog of listings, and pictures are three different stores.","unlockNodeIds":["tripdb","listdb","blob"],"unlockEdgeIds":["match->tripdb","match->listdb","cdn->blob"]},{"i":4,"blurb":"After you tap, notify the other side and take payment in the background so the app does not freeze.","unlockNodeIds":["queue","pay"],"unlockEdgeIds":["api->queue","queue->notify","queue->pay","pricing->pay","queue->kitchen"]},{"i":5,"blurb":"Push alerts and turn-by-turn routing keep both people updated on the road.","unlockNodeIds":["notify","maps","kitchen"],"unlockEdgeIds":["queue->notify","geo->maps"]}],"questions":[{"id":"doordash-0-bytes-vs-control-0-0","stage":0,"tid":"bytes-vs-control","variant":0,"correct":"split-paths","distractors":["all-cdn","all-api","all-db"],"seed":3072584823},{"id":"doordash-0-bytes-vs-control-0-1","stage":0,"tid":"bytes-vs-control","variant":1,"correct":"split-paths","distractors":["all-cdn","all-api","all-db"],"seed":3072584824},{"id":"doordash-0-bytes-vs-control-0-2","stage":0,"tid":"bytes-vs-control","variant":2,"correct":"split-paths","distractors":["all-cdn","all-api","all-db"],"seed":3072584825},{"id":"doordash-0-personalized-edge-0-0","stage":0,"tid":"personalized-edge","variant":0,"correct":"dont-cache-